# Topic access control. Keeps each identity to only the topics it needs,
# so a compromised sensor cannot command the heating, and vice versa.

# Backend application: full access to the home topic tree.
user app
topic readwrite home/#

# Air-quality sensors: may only publish their own readings.
user sensor
topic write home/+/airquality

# Radiator valves (TRVs): publish their state, receive their set-commands.
user trv
topic write home/+/radiator/state
topic read home/+/radiator/set
